{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_0161CRnuAjih9wrLuGxcEXjF","type":"tool_result","content":"The file <tmp>/measure-baseline-claude-code-001-dqcW7i/index.html has been updated successfully. (file state is current in your context — no need to Read it back)"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"674b76b5-90b4-46c8-9116-8c091a9445b0","uuid":"859a9f5c-a543-41e1-83af-930db2baf58b","timestamp":"2026-10-26T03:18:14.275Z","tool_use_result":{"filePath":"<tmp>/measure-baseline-claude-code-001-dqcW7i/index.html","oldString":"每周二、四、六烘焙，豆子不过夜寄出","newString":"线上订单在养豆完成后寄出","originalFile":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover\">\n  <title>山隅烘焙室</title>\n  <meta name=\"description\" content=\"山隅烘焙室是一间独立咖啡烘焙工作室，每周小批量烘焙单一产地咖啡豆，欢迎到店试饮、自取。\">\n  <!-- measure.css 放在第一个：它声明的 measure 层排在最前，页面上的其他样式都会优先于它 -->\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"measure.css\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n\n  <header class=\"site-head\">\n    <div class=\"wrap\">\n      <a class=\"logo\" href=\"#\">山隅烘焙室<small lang=\"en\">Shanyu Roastery</small></a>\n      <nav aria-label=\"主导航\">\n        <a href=\"#beans\">本周豆单</a>\n        <a href=\"#philosophy\">烘焙理念</a>\n        <a href=\"#visit\">到店</a>\n      </nav>\n    </div>\n  </header>\n\n  <main>\n    <section class=\"hero\">\n      <div class=\"wrap\">\n        <h1>一台 6 公斤的烘豆机，每周只烘三次。</h1>\n        <p class=\"lead measure-prose\">我们是一间开在老弄堂里的小烘焙室。生豆由我们自己挑，每一锅都由同一个人看火、记录、杯测，烘好的豆子休息够了才拿出来卖。</p>\n        <ul class=\"meta\">\n          <li><b>烘焙日</b>每周二、四、六</li>\n          <li><b>每锅</b>不超过 5 公斤生豆</li>\n          <li><b>出炉后</b>养豆 5–7 天再上架</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"block\" id=\"beans\" aria-labelledby=\"beans-title\">\n      <div class=\"wrap\">\n        <div class=\"block-head\">\n          <span class=\"num\">01</span>\n          <h2 id=\"beans-title\">本周豆单</h2>\n          <p class=\"measure-prose\">豆单随产季更换，下面是本周在架的四支。每包 200 克，标注的是我们杯测时喝到的风味，不同的冲煮方式会有出入。</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <ul class=\"beans\">\n          <li class=\"bean\">\n            <div>\n              <h3>埃塞俄比亚 古吉 罕贝拉</h3>\n              <p class=\"origin\">水洗 · 海拔 2,100–2,300 米 · 原生种</p>\n              <div class=\"roast\" aria-label=\"烘焙度：浅\">浅烘 <span class=\"bar\" style=\"--lv:1\"></span></div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"notes\">\n              <p>茉莉花香很明显，入口是柠檬和白桃，放凉之后有一点蜂蜜的甜。适合手冲，水温建议 92℃ 左右。</p>\n              <p class=\"tags\">风味：茉莉、柠檬、白桃、蜂蜜</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"side\">\n              <span class=\"price\">¥ 88</span>\n              <span>200 克</span>\n            </div>\n          </li>\n\n          <li class=\"bean\">\n            <div>\n              <h3>哥伦比亚 慧兰 粉红波旁</h3>\n              <p class=\"origin\">厌氧日晒 · 海拔 1,800 米 · 粉红波旁</p>\n              <div class=\"roast\" aria-label=\"烘焙度：浅中\">浅中烘 <span class=\"bar\" style=\"--lv:2\"></span></div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"notes\">\n              <p>果汁感强，前段是草莓和红葡萄，中段转成焦糖，尾韵干净。做冰手冲也很好喝。</p>\n              <p class=\"tags\">风味：草莓、红葡萄、焦糖、可可碎</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"side\">\n              <span class=\"price\">¥ 98</span>\n              <span>200 克</span>\n            </div>\n          </li>\n\n          <li class=\"bean\">\n            <div>\n              <h3>云南 保山 卡蒂姆</h3>\n              <p class=\"origin\">蜜处理 · 海拔 1,600 米 · 卡蒂姆</p>\n              <div class=\"roast\" aria-label=\"烘焙度：中\">中烘 <span class=\"bar\" style=\"--lv:3\"></span></div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"notes\">\n              <p>和保山的一家小农合作了第三年。烤坚果和红糖的甜，酸度温和，日常喝不容易腻，手冲和法压都合适。</p>\n              <p class=\"tags\">风味：烤杏仁、红糖、橙皮</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"side\">\n              <span class=\"price\">¥ 62</span>\n              <span>200 克</span>\n            </div>\n          </li>\n\n          <li class=\"bean\">\n            <div>\n              <h3>山隅拼配 · 意式</h3>\n              <p class=\"origin\">巴西日晒 60% · 云南蜜处理 40%</p>\n              <div class=\"roast\" aria-label=\"烘焙度：中深\">中深烘 <span class=\"bar\" style=\"--lv:4\"></span></div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"notes\">\n              <p>店里做奶咖用的就是这一支。油脂厚，黑巧克力和榛果的味道能穿透牛奶，做美式也不会发苦。</p>\n              <p class=\"tags\">风味：黑巧克力、榛果、太妃糖</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"side\">\n              <span class=\"price\">¥ 58</span>\n              <span>200 克</span>\n            </div>\n          </li>\n        </ul>\n\n        <p class=\"beans-foot measure-prose\">需要研磨请到店时告诉我们你的冲煮器具。整豆开封后建议在一个月内喝完。</p>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"block\" id=\"philosophy\" aria-labelledby=\"philo-title\">\n      <div class=\"wrap\">\n        <div class=\"block-head\">\n          <span class=\"num\">02</span>\n          <h2 id=\"philo-title\">烘焙理念</h2>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"philo\">\n          <div class=\"measure-prose\">\n            <h3>先喝生豆的样品，再决定买不买</h3>\n            <p>每年我们会杯测四十到六十支生豆样品，最后留下来的通常不到十支。挑豆的标准很简单：它本身好不好喝，以及我们能不能把它烘好。</p>\n\n            <h3>烘到<span class=\"dot\">刚好</span>，不追求越浅越好</h3>\n            <p>浅烘能保留产地风味，但烘得不够熟，喝起来会有青草味和涩感。我们会为每一支豆子单独调整曲线，让花果香出来的同时，甜感也到位。</p>\n\n            <h3>每一锅都有记录</h3>\n            <p>入豆温度、回温点、一爆时间、出锅温度，每一锅都记在本子上，也会贴在豆袋背面。下次你喝到觉得特别好的那一包，我们能找到它是怎么烘出来的。</p>\n\n            <p>我们不做大批量，也不打算开分店。<strong>能看着每一锅出炉</strong>，是我们留在这个规模的原因。</p>\n          </div>\n\n          <aside class=\"log\" aria-label=\"烘焙记录示例\">\n            <h3>一锅豆子的记录</h3>\n            <dl>\n              <dt>豆子</dt><dd>古吉 罕贝拉</dd>\n              <dt>生豆</dt><dd>4.2 kg</dd>\n              <dt>入豆</dt><dd>205℃</dd>\n              <dt>回温点</dt><dd>1:32</dd>\n              <dt>一爆</dt><dd>8:15</dd>\n              <dt>出锅</dt><dd>9:40 · 198℃</dd>\n              <dt>发展率</dt><dd>14.7%</dd>\n              <dt>失重</dt><dd>12.6%</dd>\n            </dl>\n            <p>记录卡随豆袋附送，背面写着烘焙日期和烘焙师的签名。</p>\n          </aside>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"block\" id=\"visit\" aria-labelledby=\"visit-title\">\n      <div class=\"wrap\">\n        <div class=\"block-head\">\n          <span class=\"num\">03</span>\n          <h2 id=\"visit-title\">到店</h2>\n          <p class=\"measure-prose\">店面很小，只有一张长桌和六个座位。可以试饮当周所有豆子，也可以来取线上预订的豆子。</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"visit\">\n          <div>\n            <address id=\"addr\">\n              上海市徐汇区永嘉路 312 弄 7 号\n              <span>弄堂进去右手第二家，门口有一台旧的磅秤。</span>\n            </address>\n            <button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\" data-copy=\"上海市徐汇区永嘉路 312 弄 7 号\">复制地址</button>\n\n            <div class=\"measure-prose\" style=\"margin-top: 2.5rem\">\n              <h3>怎么来</h3>\n              <ul>\n                <li>地铁 1 号线、10 号线、12 号线陕西南路站，步行约 12 分钟</li>\n                <li>附近没有停车位，建议骑车或步行前来</li>\n                <li>店内可以带宠物，请提前和我们说一声</li>\n              </ul>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div>\n            <table class=\"hours\">\n              <caption class=\"visually-hidden\" hidden>营业时间</caption>\n              <tbody>\n                <tr><th scope=\"row\">周二至周五</th><td>11:00–19:00</td></tr>\n                <tr><th scope=\"row\">周六、周日</th><td>10:00–20:00</td></tr>\n                <tr class=\"off\"><th scope=\"row\">周一</th><td>休息，烘豆日</td></tr>\n              </tbody>\n            </table>\n            <p class=\"measure-prose\" style=\"margin-top: 1.5rem; color: var(--muted)\">烘豆日店门关着，但能闻到味道。法定节假日照常营业，临时调整会提前在公众号上通知。</p>\n            <p class=\"measure-prose\" style=\"margin: 0\">电话：<span class=\"tel\">021-6400-0000</span></p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  </main>\n\n  <footer class=\"site-foot\">\n    <div class=\"wrap\">\n      <p>山隅烘焙室 · 自 2019 年起在永嘉路烘豆</p>\n      <p>每周二、四、六烘焙，豆子不过夜寄出</p>\n    </div>\n  </footer>\n\n  <script>\n    document.querySelectorAll('.copy').forEach(function (btn) {\n      btn.addEventListener('click', function () {\n        var text = btn.getAttribute('data-copy');\n        var done = function () {\n          btn.textContent = '已复制';\n          setTimeout(function () { btn.textContent = '复制地址'; }, 1800);\n        };\n        if (navigator.clipboard && navigator.clipboard.writeText) {\n          navigator.clipboard.writeText(text).then(done, function () { selectAddr(); });\n        } else {\n          selectAddr();\n        }\n      });\n    });\n    function selectAddr() {\n      var range = document.createRange();\n      range.selectNodeContents(document.getElementById('addr'));\n      var sel = window.getSelection();\n      sel.removeAllRanges();\n      sel.addRange(range);\n    }\n  </script>\n</body>\n</html>\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":198,"oldLines":7,"newStart":198,"newLines":7,"lines":["   <footer class=\"site-foot\">","     <div class=\"wrap\">","       <p>山隅烘焙室 · 自 2019 年起在永嘉路烘豆</p>","-      <p>每周二、四、六烘焙，豆子不过夜寄出</p>","+      <p>线上订单在养豆完成后寄出</p>","     </div>","   </footer>"," "]}],"userModified":false,"replaceAll":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_0161CRnuAjih9wrLuGxcEXjF","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
